{"id":"huntik:page:5562","page_id":5562,"title":"Old Madea Island inhabitant","kind":"character","namespace":0,"summary":"The old Madea Island inhabitant was an elderly woman living on Madea Island who was created as an illusion by the Titan, Madea. This inhabitant told Zhalia Moon of a vast treasure on the island, but Zhalia was not interested. After exploring the island and perceiving it to have no other inhabitants, she accepted the offer. Upon finding the source of the island's illusions, and seeing the through the inhabitant's attempt to trick her into being brainwashed by the Obelisk, Zhalia used an Augerfrost spell on the older woman, who vanished. [The Beautiful Trap]\n\nit:Isola di Madea","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:Old_Villager.png","wikitext":"File:Old_Villager.png","links":[]},"name":{"text":"","wikitext":"{{PAGENAME}}","links":[]},"aliases":{"text":"Unnamed","wikitext":"''Unnamed''","links":[]},"relations":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"residence":{"text":"Madea Island","wikitext":"[[Madea Island]]","links":[{"target_title":"Madea Island","label":"Madea Island","target_id":"huntik:page:5196","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Madea_Island","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5196"}]},"group":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"first appearance":{"text":"\"The Beautiful Trap\"","wikitext":"\"[[The Beautiful Trap]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Beautiful Trap","label":"The Beautiful Trap","target_id":"huntik:page:3371","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Beautiful_Trap","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3371"}]},"last appearance":{"text":"\"The Beautiful Trap\"","wikitext":"\"[[The Beautiful Trap]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Beautiful Trap","label":"The Beautiful Trap","target_id":"huntik:page:3371","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Beautiful_Trap","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3371"}]},"gender":{"text":"Female","wikitext":"Female","links":